<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMEIR DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMEIR DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>19 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic)</p>
<p>14 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic)</p>
<p>13 - Paul Gascoigne (Rangers)</p>
<p>12 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen)</p>
<p>11 - John Robertson (Hearts), Gerry Britton (Dunfermline)</p>
<p>10 - Brian Laudrup (Rangers), Paul Wright (Kilmarnock)</p>
<p>Darren Jackson (Hibernian)</p>
<p>9 - Ally McCoist (Rangers), Dean Windass (Aberdeen),</p>
<p>Erik Bo Andersen (Rangers), Di Canio (Celtic)</p>
</text>
